      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING COLO (1) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 1.5 lengths at Angle Park in a handy 30.46 beating She's A Jumbo. Boasts three wins from four starts out of this box. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. CYAN MAGIC (2) was drawn the middle but pinged the lids and led until the final stages, holding on for a place (30.98) at this track in a Grade 6 over 531m. Bold showing expected. NIPPY ZESTA (6) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (26.21) last time in a Grade 6 at Murray Bridge. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Cannot be left out. BLACK STINGRAY (8) will be hard to beat despite making his debut at this circuit.",
